    "text": {
     "en": "To compare two quantities, find the difference by subtracting the smaller from the larger.\nWords like more than, fewer than and how many more ask for a difference.\nThe leopards in Central India and the Eastern Ghats were 8820 in 2022, an increase of 749 from 2018. So in 2018: 8820 - 749 = 8071.\nEstimate first to check that the answer is sensible."
    }
